{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39384","headline":"边上逢薛秀才话旧 · 韦庄","name":"边上逢薛秀才话旧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前年同醉武陵亭，绝倒闲谭坐到明。\n也有绦唇歌白雪，更怜红袖夺金觥。\n秦云一散如春梦，楚市千烧作故城。\n今日皤然对芳草，不胜东望涕交横。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39384.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39384","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}